# Initial `align` graph for the region above — written during translation.
# Pre-aligns one property and one entity, so the region exercises both the
# "already aligned" (zero-new) path and the "new" path in the same run.
@prefix priv: <http://example.org/private#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix dbo:  <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/> .
@prefix dbr:  <http://dbpedia.org/resource/> .

priv:knownFor owl:equivalentProperty dbo:knownFor .
priv:Diana owl:sameAs dbr:Diana .
